  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "战前构建技能牌组后进入随机塔防关卡，没有固定无敌解，必须随战场机制不断调整策略。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "By combining pre-battle deck construction with randomized, roguelike elements, every run is filled with unpredictable challenges and infinite possibilities. There is no single \"invincible\" setup—only ultimate strategies that adapt to the ever-changing battlefield.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4501210/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "多名传奇英雄拥有独立特性，组合后触发羁绊战场效果，核心伙伴还能通过多重进化突破上限。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Summon a diverse roster of heroes, each with unique traits. Combine different heroes to trigger powerful synergies and devastating battlefield effects. Utilize the deep \"Multiple Evolution\" system to push your core companions beyond their limits, turning them into unstoppable forces on the frontlines.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4501210/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "庞大天赋树、技能卡与古代符文可自由混搭，针对特殊关卡机制和Boss定制防御流派。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Navigate extensive talent trees and unlock a massive arsenal of skill cards. Freely mix and match your customized deck with ancient Runes to forge a defensive playstyle (Build) tailored to you. Strategically counter bizarre stage mechanics and obliterate formidable bosses.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4501210/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
